  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### Edit SA800\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at 12:05 PM\n\n### There are 2 Dropdowns there on SA800 Table\n\n### \n\n### \n\nReports Dropdown: In the Reports Dropdown one can download the SA 800 PDF.\n\nAction Dropdown: In the Action Dropdown one can view the following\n\nHere the details filled in the return can be edited. Moreover, the Return can be submitted to HMRC. It also gives an option to delete the Return if the details entered are not correct.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188542\">Self Assessment Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Edit SA800\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at 12:05 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<h4><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">There are 2 Dropdowns there on SA800 Table</span></strong></h4><h4><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></h4><h4><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074121418/original/-S9QwBSTNz33B91CzJlMFb2tgWB6OJIF4w.png?1553515312\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074121418/original/-S9QwBSTNz33B91CzJlMFb2tgWB6OJIF4w.png?1553515312\" data-fileid=\"9074121418\" data-uniquekey=\"1553515305031\" style=\"width: 905px;\"></span><p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Reports Dropdown: In the Reports Dropdown one can download the SA 800 PDF.</span></p><p align=\"left\"><br></p></h4><p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074121419/original/WXhM7ABolZU8lz3eHDO_0yDhi2RAsbGKPg.png?1553515312\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074121419/original/WXhM7ABolZU8lz3eHDO_0yDhi2RAsbGKPg.png?1553515312\" data-fileid=\"9074121419\" data-uniquekey=\"1553515305031\"></span></p><p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Action Dropdown: In the Action Dropdown one can view the following</span></p><p align=\"left\"><br></p><p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074121420/original/oWTFr4G_aUnXm1Vo85sGqzVwxBB871tUpQ.png?1553515312\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074121420/original/oWTFr4G_aUnXm1Vo85sGqzVwxBB871tUpQ.png?1553515312\" data-fileid=\"9074121420\" data-uniquekey=\"1553515305031\"></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Here the details filled in the return can be edited. Moreover, the Return can be submitted to HMRC. It also gives an option to delete the Return if the details entered are not correct.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074121700/original/seyL-GCitEHQhkqgiI_GzNYdYG4_tFvCmw.png?1553515531\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" style=\"width: 983px;\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074121700/original/seyL-GCitEHQhkqgiI_GzNYdYG4_tFvCmw.png?1553515531\" data-fileid=\"9074121700\" data-uniquekey=\"1553515526871\"><br></span></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165528\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-hre